#. Upgrade sheet: the system browser could not be opened for the hosted checkout url. The app appends the url itself on the next line (selectable) so the user can copy it into a browser by hand — never advancing to the waiting page with no payment page open.
msgctxt "checkout_browser_launch_failed"
msgid "We couldn't open your browser. Copy this link into a browser to finish checkout:"
msgstr "Не удалось открыть браузер. Скопируйте эту ссылку в браузер, чтобы завершить оплату:"

#. Purchase confirmation message while the app waits for the payment to be confirmed.
msgctxt "checkout_confirming_purchase"
msgid "We're confirming your purchase. Your plan will update automatically."
msgstr "Мы подтверждаем вашу покупку. Ваш тариф обновится автоматически."

#. Checkout error in the desktop apps (the macOS direct download, Windows and Linux) when the ur.io checkout page hands back stripe_unavailable: Stripe's payment form could not be loaded in the checkout page (usually no internet connection, or a network that blocks it). Nothing was charged.
msgctxt "checkout_error_payment_form_unavailable"
msgid "The payment form couldn't load. Check your internet connection, then try again."
msgstr "Не удалось загрузить форму оплаты. Проверьте подключение к интернету и повторите попытку."

#. Checkout error in the desktop apps (the macOS direct download, Windows and Linux) when the ur.io checkout page hands back checkout_unavailable, or the server refuses to start a checkout with error.code checkout_unavailable: the site or the server cannot open Stripe's checkout right now (it has no Stripe key), so no payment form was shown and nothing was charged. The user cannot fix it; it may work later.
msgctxt "checkout_error_unavailable"
msgid "Checkout isn't available right now. Please try again later."
msgstr "Оплата сейчас недоступна. Повторите попытку позже."

#. Purchase confirmation title after the app opened Stripe's checkout page in the browser.
msgctxt "checkout_finish_in_browser"
msgid "Finish in your browser."
msgstr "Завершите в браузере."

#. Upgrade sheet waiting page: the embedded checkout webview crashed after the payment form had rendered, so a charge may already have gone through with only the redirect lost. Shown while the confirmation poll asks the server for the payment webhook; must never invite buying again.
msgctxt "checkout_interrupted_confirming"
msgid "The checkout view closed unexpectedly. If your payment went through, your plan updates here automatically — there's no need to buy again."
msgstr "Окно оплаты неожиданно закрылось. Если платёж прошёл, ваш тариф обновится здесь автоматически — покупать повторно не нужно."

#. Shown after the app hands the user to the Stripe hosted checkout in the system browser. The app polls the server and flips the plan automatically when the payment webhook lands.
msgctxt "checkout_opened_in_browser"
msgid "Complete your purchase in the browser. Your plan updates here automatically once payment is confirmed."
msgstr "Завершите покупку в браузере. Ваш тариф обновится здесь автоматически, как только платеж будет подтвержден."

#. Message after Restore purchases in the Stripe-paid app: nothing to restore locally, the app re-reads the plan from the server.
msgctxt "checkout_restore_checking"
msgid "Checking your plan again."
msgstr "Проверяем ваш тариф ещё раз."

