#. Windows Connect page status when the connection is down and the kill switch is deliberately blocking this computer's traffic.
msgctxt "conn_blocked_kill_switch"
msgid "Blocked — kill switch on"
msgstr "Заблокировано — Kill switch включён"

#. Settings: switch that connects automatically when the app starts.
msgctxt "conn_connect_on_launch"
msgid "Connect automatically when the app starts"
msgstr "Подключаться автоматически при запуске приложения"

#. Settings: explanation under the connect-on-launch switch.
msgctxt "conn_connect_on_launch_note"
msgid "Off by default. When on, URnetwork connects to your selected provider as soon as you open the app. This changes the next launch - it does not connect now."
msgstr "По умолчанию выключено. Когда включено, URnetwork подключается к выбранному провайдеру сразу после открытия приложения. Это действует со следующего запуска - сейчас подключения не будет."

#. Windows and Linux connection status (Connect page headline, status strip and tray tooltip) when a working connection dropped and the app is reconnecting on its own.
msgctxt "conn_degraded"
msgid "Connection degraded — reconnecting"
msgstr "Соединение ухудшилось — переподключение"

#. Windows Connect page status while the tunnel is being stopped but its routes are still installed.
msgctxt "conn_disconnecting"
msgid "Disconnecting — your traffic is still going through the tunnel"
msgstr "Отключение — ваш трафик всё ещё идёт через туннель"

#. Connect screen status when the connect attempt failed: no provider could be reached (the sdk's CONNECT_FAILED). The connection keeps trying, and the app offers Retry.
msgctxt "conn_failed"
msgid "Couldn't connect"
msgstr "Не удалось подключиться"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line when connecting failed.
msgctxt "conn_failed_detail"
msgid "No providers could be reached. Retry rebuilds the connection from scratch."
msgstr "Не удалось связаться ни с одним провайдером. Повторная попытка заново выстраивает соединение с нуля."

#. Windows Connect page: sentence appended to the line above when the service will stop a tunnel that carries nothing. Linux Connect page: shown on its own on the notice line under the connect controls while no other notice is there.
msgctxt "conn_failsafe_armed"
msgid "If nothing gets through shortly, URnetwork will turn the tunnel off automatically so you keep your internet."
msgstr "Если в ближайшее время ничего не пройдёт, URnetwork автоматически отключит туннель, чтобы вы не остались без интернета."

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing, while the kill switch keeps this computer blocked.
msgctxt "conn_failsafe_blocked"
msgid "The tunnel could not carry traffic, so URnetwork shut it down. The kill switch is on, so nothing leaves this machine until you connect again or turn the kill switch off — nothing is leaking."
msgstr "Туннель не мог передавать трафик, поэтому URnetwork его отключил. Kill switch включён, поэтому ничто не покидает этот компьютер, пока вы снова не подключитесь или не выключите Kill switch, — утечек нет."

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line, and Windows tray notification, after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing, with the kill switch off. Keep the emphasis on NOT.
msgctxt "conn_failsafe_restored"
msgid "URnetwork disconnected you to keep you online: the tunnel was up but nothing was getting through. Your traffic is going out normally now and is NOT protected. Press Connect to try again."
msgstr "URnetwork отключил вас, чтобы вы оставались в сети: туннель работал, но через него ничего не проходило. Сейчас ваш трафик идёт напрямую и НЕ защищён. Нажмите «Подключить», чтобы попробовать снова."

#. Connection status while the app has providers but none is proven to work yet (Linux and Windows Connect page headline, Windows tray tooltip).
msgctxt "conn_finding_providers"
msgid "Finding providers…"
msgstr "Поиск провайдеров…"

#. Connect page: warning that the internet traffic is not protected.
msgctxt "conn_not_protected"
msgid "Your internet traffic is not protected."
msgstr "Ваш интернет-трафик не защищён."

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the app's sign-in to the URnetwork platform keeps failing.
msgctxt "conn_reason_auth"
msgid "Signing in to the platform is failing…"
msgstr "Не удаётся войти на платформу…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the app cannot reach the URnetwork platform (the API servers).
msgctxt "conn_reason_platform"
msgid "Contacting the platform…"
msgstr "Связь с платформой…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the selected providers do not answer.
msgctxt "conn_reason_providers"
msgid "Providers not responding — retrying…"
msgstr "Провайдеры не отвечают — повторная попытка…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the platform asks the app to slow down.
msgctxt "conn_reason_rate_limited"
msgid "Rate limited — waiting…"
msgstr "Превышен лимит запросов — ожидание…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line while connected but no provider carries traffic, with leak protection in force (on Linux, the kill switch's block floor).
msgctxt "conn_traffic_blocked"
msgid "No working provider right now — your traffic is blocked, not exposed. Disconnect to go back to your normal connection."
msgstr "Сейчас нет работающего провайдера — ваш трафик заблокирован, а не открыт. Отключитесь, чтобы вернуться к обычному подключению."

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line while connected but no provider carries traffic, and leak protection (the Windows firewall policy, the Linux kill switch's block floor) is not in force.
msgctxt "conn_traffic_blocked_unprotected"
msgid "No working provider right now — traffic sent into the tunnel is going nowhere, and leak protection is off, so some traffic may bypass it. Disconnect to go back to your normal connection."
msgstr "Сейчас нет работающего провайдера — трафик, отправленный в туннель, никуда не уходит, а защита от утечек выключена, поэтому часть трафика может идти в обход. Отключитесь, чтобы вернуться к обычному подключению."

#. Windows tray tooltip when the kill switch is deliberately blocking this computer's traffic.
msgctxt "conn_tray_blocked_kill_switch"
msgid "Blocked (kill switch on)"
msgstr "Заблокировано (Kill switch включён)"

#. Windows tray tooltip when leak protection blocks traffic while no tunnel is up.
msgctxt "conn_tray_blocked_no_tunnel"
msgid "Blocked — leak protection is still in force with no tunnel up"
msgstr "Заблокировано — защита от утечек всё ещё действует, хотя туннель не поднят"

#. Windows tray tooltip while the tunnel is being stopped but its routes are still installed.
msgctxt "conn_tray_disconnecting"
msgid "Disconnecting — traffic is still going through the tunnel"
msgstr "Отключение — трафик всё ещё идёт через туннель"

#. Windows tray notification after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing, while the kill switch keeps this computer blocked. "This menu" is the tray icon's menu.
msgctxt "conn_tray_failsafe_blocked"
msgid "The tunnel could not carry traffic, so URnetwork shut it down. The kill switch is on, so this machine stays blocked and nothing is leaking. Reconnect, or turn off the kill switch from this menu."
msgstr "Туннель не мог передавать трафик, поэтому URnetwork его отключил. Kill switch включён, поэтому этот компьютер остаётся заблокированным и утечек нет. Подключитесь снова или выключите Kill switch в этом меню."

#. Windows tray tooltip after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing.
msgctxt "conn_tray_failsafe_stopped"
msgid "Disconnected (the tunnel failed)"
msgstr "Отключено (сбой туннеля)"

#. Windows tray menu item that stops the tunnel directly when the normal Disconnect is stuck. Linux tray menu item that stops the service's tunnel while the app holds no session of its own.
msgctxt "conn_tray_force_tunnel_off"
msgid "Force the tunnel off (recovery)"
msgstr "Принудительно выключить туннель (восстановление)"

#. Windows and Linux tray menu item that lifts the kill switch's block on this computer.
msgctxt "conn_tray_lift_kill_switch"
msgid "Turn off the kill switch (unblock this machine)"
msgstr "Выключить Kill switch (разблокировать этот компьютер)"

